  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-wangshunhua:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangshunhua:p001:m0000" ref="w4m_9tw_147_F">和帝</persName><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangshunhua:p001:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA*A">王皇后</persName>名<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangshunhua:p001:m0006" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA*A">蕣華</persName>，琅邪臨沂人，太尉<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangshunhua:p001:m0017" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA">儉</persName>孫也。初為隨王妃。中興元年，為皇后。<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangshunhua:p001:m0036" ref="w4m_9tw_147_F">帝</persName>禪位，后降為妃。</p>
